{
  "slug": "prism",
  "name": "Prism",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A Claude Code plugin that adds multi-profile code review, conventional commits, branching, and PR workflows to any repo. It auto-detects your stack and runs security, quality, performance, documentation, and testing reviewers in parallel. Works both locally via slash commands and as an automated CI reviewer on pull requests.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **25 skills** and **11 commands**.\n\n- **Skills** (25): `dependencies` (Audits and upgrades project dependencies), `documentation` (Fixes documentation issues directly — CLAUDE.md, README, docstrings, inline comments), `performance` (Reviews code for performance issues — N+1 queries, missing indexes, async correctness, caching, and frontend rendering), `quality` (Reviews code for duplication, dead code, unnecessary complexity, and verbose patterns), `rest-api` (Reviews REST API endpoints for HTTP status code correctness, response body consistency, Location headers, error envelope uniformity, and…), `security` (Reviews code for security vulnerabilities — auth, injection, secrets, headers, rate limiting, and data exposure), `stack-aspnet` (Reviews ASP.NET Core (C#) code for controller structure, dependency injection, Entity Framework usage, error handling, and configuration safety), `stack-django` (Reviews Django code for model design, query patterns, view structure, settings safety, and migration correctness), and 17 more\n- **Commands** (11): `_detect-stack`, `_verify`, `address-pr-review` (Address inline PR review comments — validate, fix root causes, reply, and resolve), `create-branch` (Create a feature, fix, or hotfix branch from the correct base), `install-ci-review` (Install the Prism CI review workflow into the current project), `open-pr` (Sync base branch, run relevant tests, open a PR), `release` (Open a release PR from dev into main for production deploy), `review-and-fix` (Review code changes and fix all findings automatically), and 3 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install prism@claude-community` from `SergiCoder/prism`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
